{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi, I'm Thomas, the creator of Kingdom: New Lands and Cloud Gardens. I've been working on a new project that elaborates on the style &amp; themes of those games but from a fresh perspective. I hope you like it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Road trip:</strong> Venture across a vast landscape scattered with abandoned landmarks and charming strangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun Vehicle Physics</strong>: Upgrade your car to travel even deeper into the wastes. Use light vehicle platforming to unlock every corner of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower Defense:</strong> Construct turrets and defend yourself from enemy bots in tense tower-defense battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quiet moments: </strong>Choose the road less traveled and take in the atmosphere of a decaying but beautiful world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/extras/garbagecountry_gif1.gif?t=1750836496\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive across a handcrafted wasteland and discover what was left behind in <i>Garbage Country, </i>a post-industrial exploration sim. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to grips with the physics of driving and upgrade your truck to journey deeper into the wastes, expanding your map as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/extras/garbagecountry_gif2.gif?t=1750836496\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast wilderness punctuated with memorable characters and haunting landmarks. Something\u2019s stirred up the bots out here, leading them to turn on humans \u2013 you included. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the materials you find to construct turrets and repel the bots in tense tower-defense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/extras/garbagecountry_gif3.gif?t=1750836496\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Above all else, <i>Garbage Country </i>is about the atmosphere; the dust, the ruins, the silence, the open road, and the haunting remnants of a long-forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530870?t=1750836496","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530870?t=1750836496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/7e60fbe1970cfb7af4e1cc42c5c39a655ac8061f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750836496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/7e60fbe1970cfb7af4e1cc42c5c39a655ac8061f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750836496","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi, I'm Thomas, the creator of Kingdom: New Lands and Cloud Gardens. I've been working on a new project that elaborates on the style &amp; themes of those games but from a fresh perspective. I hope you like it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Road trip:</strong> Venture across a vast landscape scattered with abandoned landmarks and charming strangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun Vehicle Physics</strong>: Upgrade your car to travel even deeper into the wastes. Use light vehicle platforming to unlock every corner of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower Defense:</strong> Construct turrets and defend yourself from enemy bots in tense tower-defense battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quiet moments: </strong>Choose the road less traveled and take in the atmosphere of a decaying but beautiful world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/extras/garbagecountry_gif1.gif?t=1750836496\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive across a handcrafted wasteland and discover what was left behind in <i>Garbage Country, </i>a post-industrial exploration sim. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to grips with the physics of driving and upgrade your truck to journey deeper into the wastes, expanding your map as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/extras/garbagecountry_gif2.gif?t=1750836496\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast wilderness punctuated with memorable characters and haunting landmarks. Something\u2019s stirred up the bots out here, leading them to turn on humans \u2013 you included. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the materials you find to construct turrets and repel the bots in tense tower-defense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/extras/garbagecountry_gif3.gif?t=1750836496\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Above all else, <i>Garbage Country </i>is about the atmosphere; the dust, the ruins, the silence, the open road, and the haunting remnants of a long-forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Noio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530870/ab802fc1b4b21fb8f73b42a2b3aeb811111f9c8b/header.jpg?t=1750836496","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153423,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153423/movie480.mp4?t=1749412892","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153423/movie_max.mp4?t=1749412892"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153423/e2cc7144e3eac856c8da30afc774b3b8b39eaa17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749412892","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153423/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749412892","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153423/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749412892"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257123508,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123508/movie480.mp4?t=1749403117","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123508/movie_max.mp4?t=1749403117"},"name":"Alpha Footage","thumbnail":